Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.55,0:00:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.91,0:00:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Day 1073
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.13,0:00:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Still asleep
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,although stuck in this never ending fever dream
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,don't know why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's waiting right before my door
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel it's craving for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not void of pain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel every cell as if I'm wide awake
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,when he does rip me open in my chest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.69,0:00:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and let me endure the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.03,0:00:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Day 1074
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If it wants it can make me feel a hundred knives
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,at a time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I try to move but all is frozen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,in my body fully
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It does stay outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.85,0:00:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,while it waits and I don't know why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So on the verge of insane when I hear it call
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not more than an anguished soul
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh I wonder how I'm still alive with these scars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.91,0:00:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Only thing I know by now is I'm stuck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only when I call it out by it's name he snaps
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and would end my life with these claws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.63,0:00:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to fall asleep but it wakes me up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.14,0:00:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Vivid once again, my throat has been cut
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.85,0:00:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Struggling to breathe with blood in my lungs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.33,0:01:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't let me die from things that it does
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.22,0:01:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.39,0:01:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.96,0:01:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I hope one day this mere becomes a bad memory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.18,0:01:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.58,0:01:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Forever playing with me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.29,0:01:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And it seems to know no bound in how much pain I can be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know why I've been placed and since been stuck in this place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know why I'm still praying for the time I awake
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.56,0:01:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know why god lets anybody suffer this pain
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.75,0:01:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more moment, moment
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe there is a glimpse of end in sight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.11,0:01:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.15,0:01:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,
